WEBVTT

00:01:43.070 --> 00:01:47.010
I never imagined Kai was
hiding that much power...

00:01:48.450 --> 00:01:50.300
What is this?

00:01:50.300 --> 00:01:53.780
I might be stating the obvious,
but a Blader with a rival to beat...

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:56.420
is much stronger than
I would have thought.

00:01:56.610 --> 00:02:01.510
Do you mean that Kai was able to summon all that power because he had Rei as his rival?

00:02:01.900 --> 00:02:07.100
That, and the two of them were
thinking about Takao during their battle.

00:02:07.340 --> 00:02:09.020
About Takao...

00:02:09.280 --> 00:02:12.160
Which is why they
fought so hard?

00:02:12.340 --> 00:02:17.010
And the same could be
said for Max from the PPB.

00:02:17.900 --> 00:02:23.090
So we don't know how strong Max will fight against me?

00:02:23.090 --> 00:02:24.740
Don't you worry!

00:02:24.740 --> 00:02:25.820
Takao...

00:02:25.820 --> 00:02:28.390
Don't let your guard
down. Not even for a second.

00:02:28.690 --> 00:02:30.700
Yeah, I got it.

00:02:31.720 --> 00:02:33.600
Now I'm hyped!

00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:37.950
I have to make a plan for Takao's
eventual battle against Kai.

00:02:37.950 --> 00:02:41.520
Everyone's all like,
Takao this, Takao that!

00:02:42.940 --> 00:02:46.710
Takao's not the only
Blader on this team!

00:02:46.710 --> 00:02:51.180
As long as the the great Daichi
is on this team, even Kai or Max

00:02:51.180 --> 00:02:53.280
ain't nothin' special!

00:02:53.280 --> 00:02:58.190
You're just jealous because Takao's getting all the attention, right?

00:02:59.480 --> 00:03:02.560
Ya idiot!
That's not it! Jeez!

00:03:02.560 --> 00:03:06.540
Where are you going, Daichi? Our match is about to start.

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:08.500
To the bathroom!

00:03:10.550 --> 00:03:14.220
Everyone's always
talking about Takao!

00:03:14.220 --> 00:03:17.470
He's just been
holding us back!

00:03:17.470 --> 00:03:20.560
It's Takao's fault we
lost two matches!

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:23.620
It got caught!!

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:25.600
Daichi's taking a while...

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:28.040
Don't worry about him.

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:31.920
But we need to set up his
Beyblade. That, and...

00:03:32.110 --> 00:03:33.440
What he said earlier?

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:34.370
Yes...

00:03:34.370 --> 00:03:37.700
He's right, but Takao's
last year's champion,

00:03:37.700 --> 00:03:40.320
so it's only natural he'd
get so much attention.

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:43.220
Indeed.
And that's why...

00:03:43.220 --> 00:03:47.250
I get the feeling we haven't properly acknowledged Daichi's hard work.

00:03:49.890 --> 00:03:55.140
Daichi's been performing so well
that he's effectively undefeated.

00:03:55.140 --> 00:03:56.870
Undefeated?

00:03:56.870 --> 00:04:02.760
Oh, I get it. I wonder whose fault it is
that we lost our previous matches...

00:04:04.770 --> 00:04:06.390
My bad...

00:04:06.390 --> 00:04:11.910
And Daichi has won against Neo-Borg before, who just made it to the finals.

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:19.440
Kai wasn't taking it
seriously back then, though.

00:04:19.650 --> 00:04:21.570
When you
put it that way...

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:23.400
Isn't that amazing?

00:04:23.630 --> 00:04:26.570
It is.
And yet, we've...

00:04:27.070 --> 00:04:33.390
You're right. Without his hard work, we might not have made it this far.

00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:34.740
Right...

00:04:35.490 --> 00:04:39.550
Oh well. Maybe I'll give
him a pat on the back.

00:04:39.550 --> 00:04:42.880
It'll just go to
his head again.

00:04:42.880 --> 00:04:47.090
As long as you've taken
notice, it should be fine.

00:04:47.440 --> 00:04:48.720
Coach...

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:55.020
Daichi's bad mood isn't just because of all the attention Takao gets.

00:05:00.660 --> 00:05:02.760
That was awful...

00:05:04.960 --> 00:05:06.190
It's you!

00:05:06.830 --> 00:05:09.600
You got a bone
to pick with me?!

00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:12.500
Meet me in
the finals. That's all.

00:05:12.850 --> 00:05:16.000
Are you
tellin' us to win?

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:19.390
Not "us".
My business is with you.

00:05:20.140 --> 00:05:21.370
With me?

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:23.060
I want payback.

00:05:23.060 --> 00:05:24.640
What?!

00:05:24.640 --> 00:05:27.620
So you have to
make it to the finals.

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:31.460
Yeah! As long as the one
and only Daichi is around,

00:05:31.460 --> 00:05:34.940
the BBA is gonna
make it to the finals!

00:05:35.450 --> 00:05:38.570
You've got drive,
but check your zipper.

00:05:40.950 --> 00:05:42.400
That little...

00:05:46.880 --> 00:05:49.010
What's taking him so long?

00:05:50.400 --> 00:05:52.000
It's almost time.

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:52.720
Yeah.

00:05:54.290 --> 00:05:58.230
Awright!
Let's go! Y'all ready?!

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:00.160
Daichi?

00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:04.760
What's with the lollygaggin'?!
Our match is about to start!

00:06:04.760 --> 00:06:06.640
Are you even ready?!

00:06:06.640 --> 00:06:09.760
I'm moving on ahead!
Come on!

00:06:11.380 --> 00:06:12.450
What the heck?

00:06:12.450 --> 00:06:14.580
Don't ask me...

00:06:14.580 --> 00:06:16.550
That's new...

00:06:20.400 --> 00:06:24.160
Today's the day I've been waiting for. My battle with Takao.

00:06:24.160 --> 00:06:27.560
Win or lose, I'll fight a
battle I won't regret.

00:06:29.010 --> 00:06:32.180
You guys gettin' stiff
before the battle?

00:06:32.180 --> 00:06:33.250
Come on, Rick...

00:06:33.250 --> 00:06:37.510
Max is concentrating.
Don't bother him!

00:06:37.510 --> 00:06:39.570
Concentrating?

00:06:39.570 --> 00:06:43.950
Image training for
our upcoming battle.

00:06:43.950 --> 00:06:46.930
I hope you aren't imagining
yourself holding back.

00:06:47.250 --> 00:06:50.200
I don't have that
luxury against Takao.

00:06:50.200 --> 00:06:54.060
It won't be a good battle unless
I fight with everything I've got.

00:06:55.170 --> 00:06:57.590
I'll accept that!

00:06:57.590 --> 00:06:59.570
I didn't know I
needed your approval!

00:07:00.010 --> 00:07:02.090
They don't know the
meaning of the word nervous.

00:07:02.090 --> 00:07:03.690
That's a good thing!

00:07:03.690 --> 00:07:06.780
If they felt nervous they wouldn't
be able to fight today's battle!

00:07:06.780 --> 00:07:11.450
Because we're up against Takao Kinomiya, the world champion.

00:07:11.450 --> 00:07:13.640
I'm itching for a battle.

00:07:13.640 --> 00:07:17.240
We have to do our
best against Takao!

00:07:17.240 --> 00:07:18.850
And win!

00:07:18.850 --> 00:07:19.950
Yeah!

00:07:20.190 --> 00:07:23.570
We've made it this far,
so I have nothing left to say.

00:07:23.570 --> 00:07:26.210
Just fight the way
you think you should.

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:26.960
Yeah!

00:07:26.960 --> 00:07:28.690
Thanks, mom!

00:07:28.690 --> 00:07:29.840
Go get 'em.

00:07:29.840 --> 00:07:30.960
Good luck!

00:07:30.960 --> 00:07:31.940
Thanks!

00:07:32.180 --> 00:07:36.770
You guys better fight a
battle worthy of the PPB name.

00:07:37.120 --> 00:07:39.140
Who cares.

00:07:39.140 --> 00:07:40.270
What?!

00:07:41.230 --> 00:07:44.610
Hey, come on!
The battle's about to begin!

00:07:51.480 --> 00:07:52.900
Listen up.

00:07:53.930 --> 00:07:56.960
I'll fight for
you guys too.

00:07:57.860 --> 00:07:59.280
For us?

00:08:05.700 --> 00:08:09.770
The world championships are
racing towards the conclusion!

00:08:09.770 --> 00:08:13.910
Time for the last match
of the Australian stage!

00:08:15.100 --> 00:08:19.600
The two teams that will be battling hardly need an introduction!

00:08:21.960 --> 00:08:24.190
The BBA Revolution!

00:08:24.190 --> 00:08:27.000
And the PPB All Starz!

00:08:29.120 --> 00:08:33.400
Neo-Borg has made it
to the finals with four wins.

00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:36.900
And F-Sangre is just
behind them with three wins.

00:08:36.900 --> 00:08:41.990
The BBA and PPB are tied with
two wins and two losses!

00:08:41.990 --> 00:08:46.170
Whoever wins can
catch up to F-Sangre!

00:08:46.170 --> 00:08:50.400
Which team will be victorious?!

00:08:51.360 --> 00:08:54.200
It's time for us
to battle, Max.

00:08:54.200 --> 00:08:58.510
I'm going to fight you as Takao
Kinomiya, the same as any other Blader.

00:08:59.200 --> 00:09:00.690
Takao...

00:09:00.690 --> 00:09:04.440
This is the day I've
been dreaming of.

00:09:06.700 --> 00:09:11.330
Daichi Sumeragi from the
BBA will be in the first battle!

00:09:11.330 --> 00:09:12.610
Aww yeah!

00:09:12.610 --> 00:09:15.650
And from the PPB,
Rick Anderson!

00:09:15.650 --> 00:09:21.000
It's going to be a battle
between the two power-users here!

00:09:31.520 --> 00:09:35.300
Hey, shorty. Did your
girlfriends come to cheer you on?

00:09:35.570 --> 00:09:38.340
They're waitin' for
me in the finals!

00:09:38.340 --> 00:09:40.080
Too bad for you.

00:09:40.080 --> 00:09:42.440
'Cuz we're the ones
going to the finals.

00:09:43.410 --> 00:09:44.850
We'll see about that!

00:09:44.850 --> 00:09:48.810
This is the stadium
we've prepared for them!

00:09:51.080 --> 00:09:56.970
Wow! It's a simple stadium
with a single bridge affixed to it!

00:09:56.970 --> 00:10:00.390
Simple, but attacking and
defending will be difficult!

00:10:00.390 --> 00:10:02.690
It's the Bash 'em Stadium!

00:10:03.020 --> 00:10:04.930
Now we're talkin'!

00:10:04.930 --> 00:10:07.580
Nowhere to run or hide.

00:10:07.860 --> 00:10:13.810
This stadium's single bridge mean you
have to clash head-on, power against power.

00:10:13.810 --> 00:10:17.290
It's the perfect
fit for their battle.

00:10:17.290 --> 00:10:19.800
It's monkey power
versus bull power, huh?

00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:23.030
There's no way a
monkey can beat a bull!

00:10:23.030 --> 00:10:26.210
Who you callin' a
monkey, old hag?!

00:10:26.210 --> 00:10:27.260
He heard me...

00:10:27.260 --> 00:10:29.830
Who are you
calling an old hag?!

00:10:37.830 --> 00:10:40.490
This sound reminds
me of that city.

00:10:40.490 --> 00:10:42.770
It always puts a
spring in my step.

00:10:44.650 --> 00:10:46.990
Is that racket supposed
to intimidate me?

00:10:46.990 --> 00:10:48.170
Ya damn monkey!

00:10:48.170 --> 00:10:50.580
Australian stage, third match!

00:10:50.580 --> 00:10:52.330
First battle!

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:53.560
Ready?

00:10:54.140 --> 00:10:55.410
Three!

00:10:56.020 --> 00:10:57.150
Two!

00:10:57.890 --> 00:10:59.060
One!

00:11:00.180 --> 00:11:02.210
Go, Shoot!

00:11:03.600 --> 00:11:06.000
Go, Gaia Dragoon!

00:11:06.000 --> 00:11:08.390
Knock 'em out, Rock Bison!

00:11:11.810 --> 00:11:15.400
Step aside, monkey boy!
I want the champ!

00:11:15.400 --> 00:11:20.250
Shaddup! You can talk
tough after you beat me!

00:11:26.120 --> 00:11:29.000
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade G-Revolution"

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:33.960
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade G-Revolution"

00:11:34.800 --> 00:11:36.440
Gaia Dragoon!

00:11:43.900 --> 00:11:46.210
Tear him apart, Rock Bison!

00:11:50.400 --> 00:11:54.270
It's the power battle we all wanted!
Neither one's giving an inch!

00:11:54.270 --> 00:11:57.230
It's an amazing clash of power!

00:11:57.440 --> 00:12:00.510
This guy's so strong!

00:12:00.510 --> 00:12:04.220
He can stand up against
Rock Bison's power...

00:12:07.170 --> 00:12:08.430
Darn it!

00:12:10.370 --> 00:12:12.760
What's that smell?

00:12:12.760 --> 00:12:15.750
It smells like
something's burning.

00:12:16.940 --> 00:12:20.130
I didn't think the smell
would reach all the way up here.

00:12:20.130 --> 00:12:24.100
Gosh! He can't just
attack head-on!

00:12:24.340 --> 00:12:28.080
Why don't you think a little and
attack from up high or from the side?!

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:31.920
No, both of them
have limitless power.

00:12:32.080 --> 00:12:34.970
If he even slightly changes
the angle he attacks from,

00:12:34.970 --> 00:12:37.700
he could get blasted
right out of the stadium.

00:12:37.700 --> 00:12:38.900
So then...

00:12:38.900 --> 00:12:42.150
So it's all down to luck.

00:12:42.150 --> 00:12:45.700
Their only option
is to attack head-on!

00:12:45.700 --> 00:12:47.700
But that could be bad.

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:48.760
What?

00:12:48.760 --> 00:12:52.080
Daichi has a much smaller
physique compared to Rick.

00:12:52.080 --> 00:12:54.520
Even if they're equal
when it comes to power...

00:12:54.520 --> 00:12:56.750
When it comes to
maintaining that power...

00:12:57.190 --> 00:13:01.270
Daichi! You have to
end this match fast!

00:13:01.270 --> 00:13:04.300
If I could I woulda
done it already!

00:13:05.730 --> 00:13:09.010
Full power, Gaia Dragoon!

00:13:10.540 --> 00:13:12.900
Rock Bison, we need power!

00:13:12.900 --> 00:13:14.730
More power!!

00:13:24.240 --> 00:13:25.790
A huge clash!

00:13:25.790 --> 00:13:29.550
Their amazing full-on
clash makes a loud sound!

00:13:29.550 --> 00:13:34.160
Who's going to survive?
Rock Bison or Gaia Dragoon?

00:13:34.160 --> 00:13:37.320
No one can beat you
when it comes to power!

00:13:37.320 --> 00:13:38.540
Yeah, he's right!

00:13:38.540 --> 00:13:39.930
Go, Rick!

00:13:39.930 --> 00:13:41.480
Who won?

00:13:41.480 --> 00:13:43.440
Was that sound...?

00:13:43.440 --> 00:13:45.490
Go for it, Daichi!

00:13:45.490 --> 00:13:48.370
This match is
just getting started.

00:13:51.360 --> 00:13:52.240
What?

00:13:52.240 --> 00:13:53.180
What the--

00:13:57.330 --> 00:13:58.700
Oh my!

00:13:59.220 --> 00:14:02.530
I can't believe it!
Is this even possible?

00:14:02.530 --> 00:14:07.110
Their clash has caused
the bridge itself to give out!

00:14:07.110 --> 00:14:12.640
What?! I woulda beat you if
it wasn't for this flimsy stadium!

00:14:13.050 --> 00:14:15.200
You got off easy.

00:14:16.450 --> 00:14:20.650
Could that sound be the
shockwaves that broke the bridge?

00:14:20.650 --> 00:14:23.220
Those two have
ridiculous power!

00:14:23.630 --> 00:14:24.970
Those two...

00:14:28.440 --> 00:14:32.530
I refuse to lose! Not until I
become the world champion!

00:14:32.530 --> 00:14:35.010
Refuse to lose?
Don't make me laugh!

00:14:35.010 --> 00:14:37.890
What's on the line for
us is totally different!

00:14:37.890 --> 00:14:39.140
What was that?!

00:14:39.140 --> 00:14:43.180
In my town, everyone
struggles to make it out on top.

00:14:43.180 --> 00:14:47.030
But the only ones who can are
the small handful of winners!

00:14:47.030 --> 00:14:50.910
Those who don't are kicked down
and give up on their dreams.

00:14:50.910 --> 00:14:52.170
Go for it!

00:14:52.170 --> 00:14:53.990
What the heck
are you doing?!

00:14:53.990 --> 00:14:57.580
They clash again!
Will Rock Bison win?

00:14:57.580 --> 00:14:59.900
Or will it be Gaia Dragoon?

00:15:07.570 --> 00:15:10.590
I survived that
world of battle!

00:15:10.590 --> 00:15:15.500
And to win, I carry the souls
of the losers on my shoulders!

00:15:16.100 --> 00:15:18.910
It's not my style, but I'm
fighting for them too!

00:15:18.910 --> 00:15:21.350
And that's why I'll win!

00:15:23.160 --> 00:15:25.970
Is that what he's
been fighting for?

00:15:25.970 --> 00:15:29.570
That's why Rick's been
so obsessed with winning.

00:15:29.570 --> 00:15:33.210
That's where Rick
gets his power from.

00:15:33.420 --> 00:15:36.630
Rick's got our souls
on his shoulders too.

00:15:37.680 --> 00:15:40.310
Go, Rick!
Do it for us!

00:15:40.310 --> 00:15:43.750
Beat him for all the Bladers
you've fought along the way!

00:15:43.750 --> 00:15:45.600
Yeah, for me too!

00:15:45.600 --> 00:15:46.870
And me!

00:15:46.870 --> 00:15:49.280
--Take him down, Rick!
--Take him down, Rick!

00:15:49.280 --> 00:15:51.310
No one asked you
to say all that.

00:15:54.800 --> 00:15:57.130
Hurry up and pack it in!

00:15:57.130 --> 00:16:01.100
First I'm gonna beat
you, then the champion!

00:16:04.370 --> 00:16:05.940
What's the matter, Daichi?

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:08.820
I thought you were gonna
be the best in the world!

00:16:18.860 --> 00:16:21.230
Even I...

00:16:21.230 --> 00:16:25.760
I've worked so hard
so I can defeat Takao!

00:16:32.080 --> 00:16:35.770
But guys like you
just run your mouths!

00:16:35.770 --> 00:16:39.210
The great Daichi Sumeragi
is gonna defeat Takao!

00:16:39.570 --> 00:16:43.610
So I can't accept
defeat until I beat him!

00:16:45.840 --> 00:16:48.800
You're gonna need more than
that if you wanna talk big!

00:16:52.000 --> 00:16:53.730
Why you...!

00:17:01.690 --> 00:17:08.740
Is their power showdown going to
destroy the very stadium itself now?!

00:17:09.330 --> 00:17:13.120
As if! I'm gonna knock you
flying before that happens!

00:17:13.120 --> 00:17:15.400
I like it!
Let's finish this!

00:17:15.400 --> 00:17:19.300
Ram him head on!
Drop Rock!

00:17:30.770 --> 00:17:34.000
Great Cutter!

00:17:46.400 --> 00:17:51.480
Don't even bother! No attack will
work against Rock Bison's rock!

00:17:54.380 --> 00:17:55.290
What?!

00:17:55.290 --> 00:17:56.920
Go!!

00:18:00.740 --> 00:18:02.640
Rock Bison!

00:18:25.680 --> 00:18:27.320
I lost?

00:18:27.590 --> 00:18:29.860
We have a winner!

00:18:29.860 --> 00:18:34.190
The BBA Revolution wins this
battle of the dreadnoughts!

00:18:34.190 --> 00:18:36.850
Daichi Sumeragi wins!

00:18:38.830 --> 00:18:40.580
Piece of cake...

00:18:40.990 --> 00:18:45.230
I can't lose.
Not until I beat hi--

00:18:45.530 --> 00:18:46.860
Daichi!

00:18:48.630 --> 00:18:50.000
Daichi!

00:18:50.560 --> 00:18:54.160
I'm... going to be who...

00:18:54.160 --> 00:18:56.160
Beats Takao...

00:18:56.450 --> 00:18:57.800
Daichi.

00:18:58.720 --> 00:19:00.260
We have a winner!

00:19:00.260 --> 00:19:04.280
The BBA Revolution wins this
battle of the dreadnoughts!

00:19:04.280 --> 00:19:06.440
Daichi Sumeragi wins!

00:19:06.440 --> 00:19:07.900
He lost...

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:09.760
Darn it!

00:19:10.910 --> 00:19:14.020
But he really put
up a good fight.

00:19:14.020 --> 00:19:17.960
Yeah. He fought for us too.

00:19:21.850 --> 00:19:25.130
Rick. That was a good battle.

00:19:25.130 --> 00:19:28.410
With a battle like that, even the people who lost to you would--

00:19:28.410 --> 00:19:32.170
A loss is a loss.
A good battle ain't worth shit.

00:19:34.970 --> 00:19:39.550
Until now, the way I fought was that I had
to carry the souls of the guys I beat.

00:19:39.550 --> 00:19:43.360
That's why I had to win no matter what.
I always fought my battles like that.

00:19:43.360 --> 00:19:44.900
Rick...

00:19:45.280 --> 00:19:47.580
But then I went and blew it.

00:19:48.290 --> 00:19:53.180
But it's... Not like
our team has lost yet...

00:19:53.400 --> 00:19:56.370
Well then, I'm off, Rick.

00:19:56.910 --> 00:19:58.340
Hate to ask this, but...

00:19:58.840 --> 00:20:01.660
Take my soul with you.

00:20:01.970 --> 00:20:04.220
Okay, Rick!

00:20:05.220 --> 00:20:11.410
That must be it. Daichi never forgot that you're his rival.

00:20:11.410 --> 00:20:16.070
But you only focused
on your other rivals.

00:20:16.070 --> 00:20:18.580
You're right.
I'm sorry, Daichi.

00:20:18.580 --> 00:20:21.120
You're a great rival.

00:20:21.670 --> 00:20:22.950
What?

00:20:22.950 --> 00:20:24.430
What about the battle?

00:20:24.430 --> 00:20:28.200
Don't worry.
You won, Daichi.

00:20:28.200 --> 00:20:31.300
You've got the best
power in the world!

00:20:31.300 --> 00:20:33.440
Best in the world?

00:20:33.440 --> 00:20:37.680
Now if we could just do something
about your brains, personality and face.

00:20:39.270 --> 00:20:42.270
What?! Say that one
more time, I dare you!

00:20:42.270 --> 00:20:46.130
Now if we could just do something
about your brains, personality and face.

00:20:46.130 --> 00:20:48.290
You friggin' hag!

00:20:48.660 --> 00:20:51.290
What'd you call me?!

00:20:55.580 --> 00:20:58.080
There's a burning
smell over here too...

00:20:58.790 --> 00:21:00.730
Cut it out, you two!

00:21:00.730 --> 00:21:02.710
The next battle
is going to begin!

00:21:02.710 --> 00:21:03.480
The next?

00:21:03.480 --> 00:21:04.490
Battle?

00:21:04.490 --> 00:21:07.370
Yeah.
It's finally my turn.

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:09.490
You won't hear the end of
it from me if you screw up!

00:21:09.490 --> 00:21:10.940
You can do it.

00:21:10.940 --> 00:21:13.720
You already know.
Don't lose!

00:21:13.720 --> 00:21:16.700
Yeah. I'm going to win.

00:21:18.990 --> 00:21:21.800
I accept your soul, Rick.

00:21:21.800 --> 00:21:25.930
I'm going to fight Takao with
all of your souls alongside me!

00:21:26.330 --> 00:21:27.820
I'm gonna win.

00:21:27.820 --> 00:21:29.750
Even if that means...

00:21:30.850 --> 00:21:32.860
Beating you, Max!

00:22:55.880 --> 00:22:57.580
Advancing to the finals?

00:22:57.580 --> 00:23:01.330
A third world championship win? That doesn't matter right now!

00:23:01.330 --> 00:23:04.860
I'm just going to hit
you with all I've got!

00:23:04.860 --> 00:23:06.250
Here we go, Max!

00:23:06.250 --> 00:23:10.550
I'm happy, Takao. Fighting you the way
you look now makes me happier than ever!

00:23:10.550 --> 00:23:12.980
But I can't afford to lose here!

00:23:12.980 --> 00:23:16.090
I'm proud of myself as
a member of the PPB!

00:23:16.090 --> 00:23:18.380
I'm carrying my
team's souls with me!

00:23:18.380 --> 00:23:23.260
Go, Draciel! Do it for all of us!
Go, go, GOOOOO!!
